OL,3,AFour plead guilty to arson attack on
OL,4,AJewish community ambulances
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors had said they believed the
OL,7,Fincident was a targeted attack against
OL,8,Fthe Jewish community.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
